  "method_note": "Canonical kV values are pFBA (parsimonious) vertices for the wild type and every knockout; biomass rates are read from the solution vector at the biomass reaction (cobra's pfba().objective_value returns the minimized L1 total flux, not the growth rate). Objective preservation verified per level; labels unchanged by construction and verified against the plain arm (Cohen kappa).  A GLPK simplex time limit (30 s) guards the pFBA L1 stage; timed-out or numerically failed solves fall back to the plain-FBA optimum vertex, which preserves the essentiality label by construction (per-gene solve_src column in the level CSVs)."
